          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The generalization of the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+product+of+modules"} tensor product of modules
            to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-modules"} ∞-modules
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            We start by defining a collection of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/colored+operad"} colored
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+operad"} symmetric operad
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi Tens
                    %mo ⊗
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Tens^\otimes
            parameterized by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplex+category"} simplex category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Δ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Delta
            such that for each
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi k
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplex"} simplex
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                  %mi k
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                  %mo ∈
                  %mi Delta
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [k] \in Delta
            the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebras+over+an+operad"} algebras over an operad
            over
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
                    %mi Tens
                    %mrow
